    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DETACHED 3 BEDROOM BUNGALOW ON C. 0.30 OF AN ACRE \n**POSSIBLY ELIGIBLE FOR VACANT HOMES GRANT**\n\nThis three bedroom bungalow extends to c. 116 sq. m/ 1,249 sq. ft and stands on c. 0.30 acres. The property is in need of extensive renovations throughout including the completion of a rear extension which includes a sunroom, utility room and toilet. The residence should be eligible for the vacant homes property grant of up to ?50,000. \n\nCowpasture is situated in the heart of Monasterevin and has the benefits of shops, schools, church, pubs, restaurants and train station all within a short walk. Monasterevin is a small town just off the M7 Motorway at Junction 14 only 55km southwest of the M50 with good transportation links including bus route in Town, M7 Motorway c. 3 1/2 km at Junction 14 and train service direct to City Centre. Kildare Village is only a 10 minute drive offering designer shopping at discounted prices.\n\nOutside \nOff street parking.\nLarge front and rear garden.\n\nServices \nMains water, mains drainage, electricity, refuse collection."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (14.93ft x 3.77ft) Laminate floor and coving. <br>Living Room (12.30ft x 12.14ft) Laminate floor and brick surround fireplace. <br>Kitchen (12.07ft x 10.27ft) Tiled floor and stanley range cooker. <br>Sunroom (15.91ft x 11.58ft) Part complete extension. <br>Utility Room Tiled floor. <br>Back Hall Concrete floor. <br>Bedroom 1 (11.81ft x 10.66ft) Laminate floor. <br>Bedroom 2 (13.88ft x 11.78ft) Laminate floor. <br>Bedroom 3 (10.66ft x 10.50ft) Laminate floor and built in wardrobes. <br>Bathroom Tiled surround, w.c , w.h.b. "
      },
      {
